          "snippet": {
            "line": 79,
            "text": "theorem eta2_eq_integral {x : ℝ} (hx : 0 < x) {m n : ℕ} (hm : 1 ≤ m) (hn : 1 ≤ n) {A B : ℝ}\n    (hA : 0 < A) (hAB : A ≤ B) (hAlo : A ≤ max (x / (2 * m)) n)\n    (hhiB : min (x / m) (2 * n) ≤ B) :\n    eta2 (m * n / x) = 4 * ∫ W in A..B,\n      (if x / (2 * W) < m ∧ (m : ℝ) ≤ x / W ∧ W / 2 < n ∧ (n : ℝ) ≤ W then 1 / W else 0) :=",
